# Marketplace (Fab) assets - not redistributed in this public repository.
# Their licenses do not allow redistribution, and they exceed the GitHub LFS
# quota (about 1.4 GB). To open the project, add them from Fab yourself:
#   - DynamicMeshCreator  -> Content/DynamicMeshCreator/
#   - Megascans           -> Content/Fab/
#       Surfaces: Dirty Concrete Floor
#       Decals:   Concrete Crack (sdnqgfi, sezrfcg, sfilvlg), Asphalt Crack,
#                 Concrete Patch, Rock Patch, Military Trenches Metal Rust 01
# Without them the levels still open, but the referenced meshes, materials
# and textures show as missing.
/Content/DynamicMeshCreator/
/Content/Fab/

